    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Graphic and digital designer; co-founder, Partner and Design Director at MOUTHWASH Studio (Los Angeles, founded 2019; clients include Nike, Comme des Garcons, Seed, Air Company, The North Face, Utah Jazz). Works from Salt Lake City. Seniority: senior, design-director level, about 13 years: Ueno (SF, 2015 to 2017), BASIC/DEPT (San Diego, senior designer, 2017 to 2019), Random Studio (Amsterdam, senior designer, 2019 to 2021), Mouthwash partner since 2021. Self-described focus: graphic design, typography, systems, motion and new technologies. Autonomy 5: co-runs a studio and leads projects as design director (inferred from roles, no first-hand evidence). Work Status Studio: his site title, IG bio and LinkedIn all say partner at Mouthwash. Mouthwash work is a team effort, so his personal authorship of each project is not proven. Found via Natalia Odezka's site (discovery path, not a vouch). Email from his own Behance profile. Work captured from Mouthwash case studies that credit him under Design (Seed, Bonnie Clyde, Air Company); benmingo.com loads its image index by script and could not be extracted, so it appears only as the Website shot.",
